{"total": 54.484, "lines": [{"cap": "This bike was so fast… they banned it.", "start": 0.36, "end": 2.211, "audio_at": 0.3, "dur": 2.0909999999999997, "words": [{"text": "This", "start": 0.36, "end": 0.492}, {"text": "bike", "start": 0.504, "end": 0.709}, {"text": "was", "start": 0.721, "end": 0.865}, {"text": "so", "start": 0.877, "end": 1.165}, {"text": "fast", "start": 1.177, "end": 1.622}, {"text": "they", "start": 1.646, "end": 1.754}, {"text": "banned", "start": 1.766, "end": 2.055}, {"text": "it", "start": 2.067, "end": 2.211}]}, {"cap": "In 1933, a French cyclist nobody had heard of showed up to a race… lying down.", "start": 2.831, "end": 7.915, "audio_at": 2.771, "dur": 5.324084, "words": [{"text": "In 1933", "start": 2.831, "end": 3.997}, {"text": "a", "start": 4.273, "end": 4.321}, {"text": "French", "start": 4.333, "end": 4.658}, {"text": "cyclist", "start": 4.67, "end": 5.163}, {"text": "nobody", "start": 5.175, "end": 5.535}, {"text": "had", "start": 5.547, "end": 5.655}, {"text": "heard", "start": 5.668, "end": 5.896}, {"text": "of", "start": 5.908, "end": 5.968}, {"text": "showed", "start": 5.98, "end": 6.256}, {"text": "up", "start": 6.268, "end": 6.401}, {"text": "to", "start": 6.413, "end": 6.533}, {"text": "a", "start": 6.545, "end": 6.629}, {"text": "race", "start": 6.641, "end": 7.122}, {"text": "lying", "start": 7.326, "end": 7.579}, {"text": "down", "start": 7.591, "end": 7.915}]}, {"cap": "His name was Francis Faure, and his bike looked ridiculous: long, low, and he rode it on his back.", "start": 8.435, "end": 14.541, "audio_at": 8.375, "dur": 6.34575, "words": [{"text": "His", "start": 8.435, "end": 8.531}, {"text": "name", "start": 8.543, "end": 8.724}, {"text": "was", "start": 8.736, "end": 8.868}, {"text": "Francis", "start": 8.88, "end": 9.325}, {"text": "Faure", "start": 9.337, "end": 9.649}, {"text": "and", "start": 10.022, "end": 10.058}, {"text": "his", "start": 10.07, "end": 10.178}, {"text": "bike", "start": 10.19, "end": 10.43}, {"text": "looked", "start": 10.442, "end": 10.683}, {"text": "ridiculous", "start": 10.695, "end": 11.416}, {"text": "long", "start": 11.8, "end": 12.257}, {"text": "low", "start": 12.642, "end": 12.954}, {"text": "and", "start": 13.315, "end": 13.411}, {"text": "he", "start": 13.423, "end": 13.507}, {"text": "rode", "start": 13.519, "end": 13.784}, {"text": "it", "start": 13.796, "end": 13.856}, {"text": "on", "start": 13.868, "end": 13.988}, {"text": "his", "start": 14.0, "end": 14.132}, {"text": "back", "start": 14.144, "end": 14.541}]}, {"cap": "The crowd laughed.", "start": 15.161, "end": 15.882, "audio_at": 15.101, "dur": 0.961167, "words": [{"text": "The", "start": 15.161, "end": 15.209}, {"text": "crowd", "start": 15.221, "end": 15.497}, {"text": "laughed", "start": 15.509, "end": 15.882}]}, {"cap": "Then he started winning.", "start": 16.502, "end": 17.319, "audio_at": 16.442, "dur": 1.0572920000000001, "words": [{"text": "Then", "start": 16.502, "end": 16.586}, {"text": "he", "start": 16.598, "end": 16.682}, {"text": "started", "start": 16.694, "end": 17.019}, {"text": "winning", "start": 17.031, "end": 17.319}]}, {"cap": "He was beating top professional riders. Guys who were way stronger than him.", "start": 17.939, "end": 21.617, "audio_at": 17.879, "dur": 3.917875, "words": [{"text": "He", "start": 17.939, "end": 17.999}, {"text": "was", "start": 18.011, "end": 18.156}, {"text": "beating", "start": 18.168, "end": 18.492}, {"text": "top", "start": 18.504, "end": 18.757}, {"text": "professional", "start": 18.769, "end": 19.346}, {"text": "riders", "start": 19.358, "end": 19.838}, {"text": "Guys", "start": 20.235, "end": 20.475}, {"text": "who", "start": 20.487, "end": 20.56}, {"text": "were", "start": 20.572, "end": 20.68}, {"text": "way", "start": 20.692, "end": 20.824}, {"text": "stronger", "start": 20.836, "end": 21.257}, {"text": "than", "start": 21.269, "end": 21.425}, {"text": "him", "start": 21.437, "end": 21.617}]}, {"cap": "The secret? Lying down, he cut through the wind. Less air pushing back means more speed from the same legs.", "start": 22.237, "end": 28.295, "audio_at": 22.177, "dur": 6.297708999999999, "words": [{"text": "The", "start": 22.237, "end": 22.285}, {"text": "secret", "start": 22.297, "end": 22.73}, {"text": "Lying", "start": 23.127, "end": 23.391}, {"text": "down", "start": 23.403, "end": 23.752}, {"text": "he", "start": 23.908, "end": 24.004}, {"text": "cut", "start": 24.016, "end": 24.232}, {"text": "through", "start": 24.244, "end": 24.401}, {"text": "the", "start": 24.413, "end": 24.497}, {"text": "wind", "start": 24.509, "end": 24.833}, {"text": "Less", "start": 25.23, "end": 25.446}, {"text": "air", "start": 25.458, "end": 25.603}, {"text": "pushing", "start": 25.615, "end": 25.987}, {"text": "back", "start": 25.999, "end": 26.336}, {"text": "means", "start": 26.348, "end": 26.576}, {"text": "more", "start": 26.588, "end": 26.841}, {"text": "speed", "start": 26.853, "end": 27.273}, {"text": "from", "start": 27.285, "end": 27.442}, {"text": "the", "start": 27.454, "end": 27.526}, {"text": "same", "start": 27.538, "end": 27.814}, {"text": "legs", "start": 27.826, "end": 28.295}]}, {"cap": "So he went for the biggest record in cycling: how far can you ride in one hour?", "start": 28.915, "end": 32.773, "audio_at": 28.855, "dur": 4.098166, "words": [{"text": "So", "start": 28.915, "end": 29.011}, {"text": "he", "start": 29.023, "end": 29.119}, {"text": "went", "start": 29.131, "end": 29.299}, {"text": "for", "start": 29.312, "end": 29.396}, {"text": "the", "start": 29.408, "end": 29.528}, {"text": "biggest", "start": 29.6, "end": 29.949}, {"text": "record", "start": 29.961, "end": 30.237}, {"text": "in", "start": 30.249, "end": 30.333}, {"text": "cycling", "start": 30.345, "end": 30.778}, {"text": "how", "start": 31.259, "end": 31.379}, {"text": "far", "start": 31.391, "end": 31.619}, {"text": "can", "start": 31.631, "end": 31.751}, {"text": "you", "start": 31.763, "end": 31.848}, {"text": "ride", "start": 31.86, "end": 32.112}, {"text": "in", "start": 32.124, "end": 32.22}, {"text": "one", "start": 32.232, "end": 32.413}, {"text": "hour", "start": 32.425, "end": 32.773}]}, {"cap": "That record had stood for nineteen years.", "start": 33.293, "end": 35.192, "audio_at": 33.233, "dur": 2.139042, "words": [{"text": "That", "start": 33.293, "end": 33.425}, {"text": "record", "start": 33.437, "end": 33.702}, {"text": "had", "start": 33.714, "end": 33.858}, {"text": "stood", "start": 33.87, "end": 34.182}, {"text": "for", "start": 34.194, "end": 34.315}, {"text": "nineteen", "start": 34.327, "end": 34.723}, {"text": "years", "start": 34.735, "end": 35.192}]}, {"cap": "Faure smashed it.", "start": 35.812, "end": 36.401, "audio_at": 35.752, "dur": 0.8289579999999999, "words": [{"text": "Faure", "start": 35.812, "end": 35.884}, {"text": "smashed", "start": 35.896, "end": 36.257}, {"text": "it", "start": 36.269, "end": 36.401}]}, {"cap": "So the people who ran cycling held a meeting… and decided his bike wasn't a bicycle anymore.", "start": 37.121, "end": 41.869, "audio_at": 37.061, "dur": 4.987583, "words": [{"text": "So", "start": 37.121, "end": 37.217}, {"text": "the", "start": 37.229, "end": 37.313}, {"text": "people", "start": 37.325, "end": 37.626}, {"text": "who", "start": 37.638, "end": 37.77}, {"text": "ran", "start": 37.782, "end": 38.035}, {"text": "cycling", "start": 38.047, "end": 38.479}, {"text": "held", "start": 38.491, "end": 38.684}, {"text": "a", "start": 38.696, "end": 38.72}, {"text": "meeting", "start": 38.732, "end": 39.14}, {"text": "and", "start": 39.429, "end": 39.489}, {"text": "decided", "start": 39.501, "end": 39.934}, {"text": "his", "start": 39.946, "end": 40.066}, {"text": "bike", "start": 40.078, "end": 40.438}, {"text": "wasn't", "start": 40.547, "end": 40.823}, {"text": "a", "start": 40.835, "end": 40.883}, {"text": "bicycle", "start": 40.895, "end": 41.412}, {"text": "anymore", "start": 41.424, "end": 41.869}]}, {"cap": "His record didn't count. His bike was banned from races.", "start": 42.489, "end": 45.397, "audio_at": 42.429, "dur": 3.148625, "words": [{"text": "His", "start": 42.489, "end": 42.609}, {"text": "record", "start": 42.621, "end": 42.945}, {"text": "didn't", "start": 42.957, "end": 43.174}, {"text": "count", "start": 43.186, "end": 43.546}, {"text": "His", "start": 43.943, "end": 44.051}, {"text": "bike", "start": 44.063, "end": 44.304}, {"text": "was", "start": 44.316, "end": 44.46}, {"text": "banned", "start": 44.472, "end": 44.736}, {"text": "from", "start": 44.748, "end": 44.904}, {"text": "races", "start": 44.917, "end": 45.397}]}, {"cap": "And to this day, you will never see a lying-down bike in a pro race.", "start": 46.117, "end": 49.951, "audio_at": 46.057, "dur": 4.074125, "words": [{"text": "And", "start": 46.117, "end": 46.189}, {"text": "to", "start": 46.201, "end": 46.298}, {"text": "this", "start": 46.31, "end": 46.514}, {"text": "day", "start": 46.526, "end": 46.814}, {"text": "you", "start": 47.211, "end": 47.259}, {"text": "will", "start": 47.271, "end": 47.379}, {"text": "never", "start": 47.391, "end": 47.668}, {"text": "see", "start": 47.68, "end": 47.896}, {"text": "a", "start": 47.908, "end": 47.992}, {"text": "lying-down", "start": 48.004, "end": 48.641}, {"text": "bike", "start": 48.653, "end": 48.99}, {"text": "in", "start": 49.062, "end": 49.146}, {"text": "a", "start": 49.158, "end": 49.206}, {"text": "pro", "start": 49.218, "end": 49.483}, {"text": "race", "start": 49.495, "end": 49.951}]}, {"cap": "Was it cheating… or just genius? Tell me in the comments.", "start": 50.671, "end": 53.724, "audio_at": 50.611, "dur": 3.292875, "words": [{"text": "Was", "start": 50.671, "end": 50.78}, {"text": "it", "start": 50.792, "end": 50.864}, {"text": "cheating", "start": 50.876, "end": 51.26}, {"text": "or", "start": 51.573, "end": 51.645}, {"text": "just", "start": 51.657, "end": 51.849}, {"text": "genius", "start": 51.861, "end": 52.366}, {"text": "Tell", "start": 52.763, "end": 52.871}, {"text": "me", "start": 52.883, "end": 52.979}, {"text": "in", "start": 52.991, "end": 53.051}, {"text": "the", "start": 53.063, "end": 53.135}, {"text": "comments", "start": 53.147, "end": 53.724}]}]}